    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Canal Gardens is one of Castlethorn's newest residential developments, offering an exceptional collection of beautifully designed three and four-bedroom family homes. Ideally positioned between Dublin's Royal Canal and the prestigious Luttrellstown Castle Estate, Canal Gardens reflects Castlethorn's longstanding reputation for delivering outstanding quality homes in Dublin 15.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by some of the area's most treasured amenities, residents can enjoy the natural beauty of Phoenix Park and the Strawberry Beds, along with an excellent selection of nearby GAA, rugby, soccer, and golf clubs. Combining peaceful surroundings with outstanding convenience, Canal Gardens presents a rare opportunity to own a high-quality new home in one of Dublin 15's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nPerfectly suited to modern family living, the development offers the ideal balance between a tranquil setting and excellent connectivity. With easy access to the M50, Coolmine Train Station just a short walk away, and regular Dublin Bus services nearby, residents can travel effortlessly to Dublin city centre and destinations further afield.\r\n\r\nRegister your interest today or contact Savills New Homes on 01 618 1300 to find out more about this exciting new development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Brand new 3 and 4 bedroom houses\r\nBER A2 Rated - Eligible for Green Mortgages\r\nSurrounded by open parkland and located next to the Royal Canal\r\nA development by Castlethorn - Creating great places for over 35 years"
      },
      {
